        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(vi) An Employee who elects to purchase a home will be eligible to reimbursement of the incurred expenses listed in subparagraph (A) through (J) below, for amount not to exceed $750, or 2% of the purchase price, whichever is greater, in taking title (closing costs) on the purchase of a house provided such house is to be used as the Employee's principal residence, the house is either a one- or two-family dwelling and is not to be used for commercial purposes. The transaction of purchase shall be completed within six (6) months following the date of the Employee's Transfer. Such expenses shall be substantiated by invoices or a copy of the closing statements:",
